      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "kissing her",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/001_director_707f8b1a76f_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.495,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "sourceEntry": 642,
      "speaker": "PIERCE",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "We can’t have you being inhibited, can we? I don’t have to make a noise.",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/002_pierce_7408fda90e5_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 4.04,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "James"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "sourceEntry": 643,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "stage_direction_before",
      "text": "GWENDOLYN giggles. They kiss again.",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/003_director_b3f982608e6_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.457,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "sourceEntry": 643,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "becoming an efficient scoutmaster",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/004_director_35dd940c52a_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.334,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "sourceEntry": 643,
      "speaker": "PIERCE",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Now I’ve checked every corner of the tent. I don’t think there are any spiders. I wish we weren’t so low on the ground, though. It’s the grass. They could be hiding in the grass.",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/005_pierce_99668d18535_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 9.381,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "James"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "sourceEntry": 644,
      "speaker": "GWENDOLYN",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Oh Pierce. It’s quite safe. I’m sure.",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/006_gwendolyn_c6ebc2f1311_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.183,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Lily - Velvety Actress"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "sourceEntry": 645,
      "speaker": "PIERCE",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "You never know. And check the sleeping bags before you get into them. Better to be safe than sorry.",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/007_pierce_eb9ebe354d4_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 5.805,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "James"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "sourceEntry": 646,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "getting worried",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/008_director_12892439498_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.659,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "sourceEntry": 646,
      "speaker": "GWENDOLYN",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Oh Pierce, really?",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/009_gwendolyn_90b0907fd92_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.393,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Lily - Velvety Actress"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "sourceEntry": 647,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "stage_direction_before",
      "text": "They exit to the annexe. RODNEY emerges from behind the curtains of the double bed. He has pulled his trousers up.",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/010_director_5395e583c0d_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 4.343,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "sourceEntry": 647,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "in a whisper",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/011_director_e304adfe905_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.721,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "sourceEntry": 647,
      "speaker": "RODNEY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Oh, hell. This is terrible.",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/012_rodney_9f1409c7098_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.393,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Ty Frost private clone"
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "sourceEntry": 647,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "PENNY emerges.",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/013_director_0ec8c3e009a_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.811,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "sourceEntry": 647,
      "speaker": "RODNEY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "We can’t get out!",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/014_rodney_068a8ce12dc_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.115,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Ty Frost private clone"
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "sourceEntry": 648,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "They’ll go to bed in a minute. They didn’t see us. If they come in, we’ll pretend to be making the bed.",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/015_penny_64ed0ae2c62_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 6.78,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "sourceEntry": 649,
      "speaker": "RODNEY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Use your head, Penny. They won’t believe that! We weren’t here a minute ago, to all intents and purposes. How did we suddenly get here? This must never happen again. My nerves won’t stand it.",
      "src": "audio/pages/41/lines/016_rodney_ae36eda7fc1_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 9.427,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Ty Frost private clone"
    },
    {
      "n": 17,
      "sourceEntry": 650,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
